# The sample comic opens with the page to itself: no clock, no bar and no
# position over the art. The middle opens the controls, which say the page.
wait-for Try a sample comic
tap Try a sample comic
wait-for CBZ
tap-at 536,1378
wait-for Available on this reader
tap Open
wait-for-id comic-next
wait-idle
expect-missing Page 1 of
expect-missing Reading
clean
shot reading
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Fit page
expect Page 1 of
clean
shot controls
